                                                "sense_id": "a9526418-f729-340f-b46a-f310125053dd",
                                                "text": "The endemic religion of Easter Island arrived with the Polynesian settlers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eeb3ef71-efac-344d-8770-bcb9b507a8e5",
                                        "entry_id": "b6d61c3f-9d31-3720-a72a-035ae1bc32d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peculiar to a particular area or region; not found in other places."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eacb5370-54d3-4e93-b0c9-ac0c77a82ede",
                                                "sense_id": "eeb3ef71-efac-344d-8770-bcb9b507a8e5",
                                                "text": "Kangaroos are endemic to Australia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23c5993a-b8b6-4930-a26c-5128d01319c3",
                                                "sense_id": "eeb3ef71-efac-344d-8770-bcb9b507a8e5",
                                                "text": "[…] a continental northern Alaskan element, including a series of endemic species and disjuncts that have survived the Pleistocene glaciation in northern Alaska and thus represent relicts of the much warmer Tertiary […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d24beb9-5f86-3685-ab9e-fe4d2b618208",
                                        "entry_id": "b6d61c3f-9d31-3720-a72a-035ae1bc32d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prevalent in a particular area or region, persistent within a population."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f09880d-7f09-4627-bc2b-800ee222a673",
                                                "sense_id": "3d24beb9-5f86-3685-ab9e-fe4d2b618208",
                                                "text": "Malaria is endemic to the tropics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4f856b1-949b-4fa3-ac10-fd560e508c90",
                                                "sense_id": "3d24beb9-5f86-3685-ab9e-fe4d2b618208",
                                                "text": "1998, Gillian Catriona Ramchand, Deconstructing the Lexicon, in Miriam Butt and Wilhelm Geuder, eds. “The Projection of Arguments”\nThese problems are endemic to the theory of thematic roles as currently conceived, because the classification it implies simply does not correspond to legitimate linguistic semantic definitions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "558aed8a-4189-441a-926d-8592a32121f1",
                                                "sense_id": "3d24beb9-5f86-3685-ab9e-fe4d2b618208",
                                                "text": "In a country where corruption is endemic, no evidence has been presented that Ms Yingluck took any money from the rice scheme, which in 2012 and 2013 cost Thailand billions of dollars. But a state-appointed committee last year ordered her to pay the fine, finding she was to blame, even though it was government policy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
